[00:37.88]It's a popular place for tourists in those months.
[00:40.94]But winters are long and hard, and the life for the 250 people in the village isn't easy at all.
[00:49.91]The roads are covered in ice, and the sea is frozen, too.
[00:56.48]The Inuits don't have a lot of choices for food.
[01:00.98]The summer is too short and not long enough for the Inuits to grow vegetables.
[01:06.70]They sometimes find berries during the warmer months.
[01:09.86]And they eat seaweed.
[01:11.96]But there are no other vegetables, so they don't eat enough greens.
[01:17.68]There is a shop in the village, but during the winter it doesn't get any fresh vegetables.
